   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 2,
   "cooked": "<p>I would hope that this could be approved with near immediacy. Is there no potential with the current org structure to have something like a prepaid business credit card ie BitPay, <a href=\"http://cryptopay.me\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">cryptopay.me</a>, etc etc and relieve Griff of the burden of using his own personal accounts like this?</p>",
   "action": null,
